{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34335","headline":"江南冬至和人怀洛下 · 陆龟蒙","name":"江南冬至和人怀洛下","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔居清洛涯，长恨苦寒迟。\n自作江南客，稀迟下雪时。\n有烟栖菊梗，无冻落杉枝。\n背日能寻径，临风尚覆棋。\n鸟声浑欲转，草色固应知。\n与看平湖上，东流或片澌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34335.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34335","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}